@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_TOKEN
@writerToken = REPLACE_WITH_RESEARCH_WRITER_TOKEN
@readerToken = REPLACE_WITH_RESEARCH_READER_TOKEN
@cursor = REPLACE_WITH_CURSOR_FROM_SYNC_RESPONSE

### 1. 管理员创建主题
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/topics/research
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./topic.json

### 2. 管理员发布模板
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/templates/report-card/versions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./template.json

### 3. 业务方发布生成中（首次创建）
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/topics/research/items/daily-2026-09-08
Authorization: Bearer {{writerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: daily-2026-09-08-running
If-None-Match: *

< ./publish-running.json

### 4. 手机首次同步；保存响应 next_cursor 到上方 cursor 变量
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/topics/research/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### 5. 同时更新展示条目并发出独立通知；原样重试整个请求
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/topics/research/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{writerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: daily-2026-09-08-completed

< ./publication-combined.json

### 6. 手机增量补取；后续每次换成实际返回的 next_cursor
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/topics/research/sync?cursor={{cursor}}&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### 7. 浏览历史（不触发提醒）
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/topics/research/history?item_id=daily-2026-09-08&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### 8. 删除当前条目；历史保留
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/topics/research/items/daily-2026-09-08
Authorization: Bearer {{writerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: daily-2026-09-08-delete
If-Match: "2"

### 单独运行：订阅变化提示；该请求会保持连接
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/topics/research/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### 9. 只发送通知，不创建小组件展示条目
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/topics/research/notifications/backup-failed
Authorization: Bearer {{writerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: backup-failed-2026-09-08

< ./notification-only.json

### 10. 清除通知，保留历史，不影响展示条目
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/topics/research/notifications/backup-failed
Authorization: Bearer {{writerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: backup-failed-clear-2026-09-08
